---
import Service from '../../layouts/Service.astro';
---
<Service
  title="Revenue Record & Land Dispute Consultancy"
  seoTitle="Revenue Record Consultancy in Punjab – Old Land Disputes, Mutation (Intiqal), Partition & Inheritance | Naqsha Zameen"
  slug="land-consultancy"
  urdu="ریونیو ریکارڈ، انتقال، تقسیم اور وراثت کے پرانے تنازعات میں ماہرانہ مشاورت"
  description="Senior consultancy in Punjab for old land disputes in the revenue record: mutations (intiqal), partition (taqseem), inheritance (wirasat), record correction and revenue-court proceedings."
  icon="shield"
  accent="from-violet-500 to-fuchsia-400"
  lead="Many land disputes go back decades: a mutation entered wrongly, an inheritance never transferred, a partition that exists on the ground but not in the record, or shares that changed hands without the paperwork following. Our senior consultants have long experience in the revenue system. We trace the history of the land through the old record, find where it went wrong, and show you the correct way to resolve it, working alongside your advocate."
  waText="Assalam-o-Alaikum, I need consultancy about a revenue record / land dispute."
  ctaLabel="Book a confidential consultation"
  benefits={[
    { icon: 'clock', title: 'Old & Complex Disputes', text: 'Cases that have run for years or generations: we untangle the history, entry by entry.' },
    { icon: 'file', title: 'Mutations (Intiqal)', text: 'Wrong, missing, pending or challenged mutations: sale, gift (hiba), inheritance and exchange.' },
    { icon: 'users', title: 'Inheritance (Wirasat)', text: 'Transfer of a deceased owner’s land to all legal heirs, share calculation, and disputes among heirs.' },
    { icon: 'layers', title: 'Partition (Taqseem)', text: 'Private and revenue-court partition of joint land (khewat), and bringing an existing family division into the record.' },
    { icon: 'search', title: 'Record Tracing & Correction', text: 'Following ownership back through old jamabandis, misl haqiyat and mutation registers, and correcting errors in the record (fard badr).' },
    { icon: 'shield', title: 'Revenue-Court Matters', text: 'Guidance on applications, objections and appeals before the Tehsildar, Assistant Commissioner, Additional Deputy Commissioner (Revenue), Commissioner and Board of Revenue.' },
  ]}
  deliverables={[
    'Confidential review of your documents and the case history',
    'Ownership trail of the land through old and current revenue records',
    'Written opinion: what went wrong, your rights and shares, and the risks',
    'Recommended course of action: correction, mutation, partition or appeal',
    'Help with obtaining certified copies of old records',
    'Ongoing guidance and coordination with your advocate during proceedings',
  ]}
  useCases={['Disputed or wrong mutation', 'Inheritance not transferred', 'Disputes among heirs', 'Joint khewat partition', 'Old record errors', 'Gift (hiba) & sale entries', 'Record vs possession mismatch', 'Title check before buying']}
  process={[
    { title: 'Confidential Consultation', text: 'Tell us the issue in a meeting or on WhatsApp, and share whatever documents you have.' },
    { title: 'Record Research', text: 'We trace the land through the revenue record, old and new, to establish the full history.' },
    { title: 'Opinion & Strategy', text: 'You get a clear written opinion and the right route to resolve the matter.' },
    { title: 'Guidance to Resolution', text: 'We support you and your advocate through correction, mutation, partition or appeal.' },
  ]}
  faqs={[
    { q: 'What kind of cases do you handle?', a: 'Revenue-record matters: disputed or wrong mutations (intiqal), inheritance (wirasat) not transferred or contested, partition (taqseem) of joint land, errors in jamabandi or khasra girdawari, and old ownership disputes. Many of our cases are years or decades old.' },
    { q: 'Are you lawyers?', a: 'No. We are senior revenue-record consultants. We establish the facts from the record and advise on the correct revenue procedure; your advocate represents you in court, and we work closely with them.' },
    { q: 'My dispute is very old. Can it still be resolved?', a: 'Often, yes. Old record such as previous jamabandis, mutation registers and misl haqiyat can show how ownership changed over time. We review the full history before advising whether correction, a fresh mutation, partition or an appeal is the right route.' },
    { q: 'Which documents should I bring?', a: 'Whatever you have: fard, jamabandi copies, mutation (intiqal) copies, registry, inheritance documents, family tree (shajra nasab), and any court or revenue-office papers. If something is missing we will tell you how to obtain it.' },
    { q: 'Do you also measure the land?', a: 'Our consultancy is about the record. If a case also needs the ground position, our separate RTK survey service can measure it.' },
    { q: 'Is my case kept confidential?', a: 'Yes. Your documents and details are used only for your case and are never shared without your permission.' },
    { q: 'What does consultancy cost?', a: 'It depends on the case. Share a short description on WhatsApp for an initial assessment and a quote.' },
  ]}
/>
